TITLE 1D transport 10 cells, exchange 0.001 mol/cell
SOLUTION 0 Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1-10
    EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
END
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -time_step 1
    -punch_cells 1
    -print_cells 1
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step sc
10 PUNCH TOT("SC")
END
